#. type: Title ###
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "Listen address (`http.host`)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "Default bind is `127.0.0.1:2658` (loopback only). For LAN access via `http://<PC-IP>:2658/web` or a local hostname such as `http://galaxy:2658/web`, set:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:62
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"http:\n"
"  host: 0.0.0.0\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:68
msgid ""
"Multiple binds (distinct interfaces only — not client-facing aliases). Use "
"`0.0.0.0` instead of listing every IP; do not mix `0.0.0.0` with specific "
"addresses. Hostnames must resolve on the Hub machine (`/etc/hosts` or DNS):"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:69
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"http:\n"
"  host:\n"
"    - 127.0.0.1\n"
"    - 10.244.0.2\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:77
msgid ""
"CLI `--host` overrides config for a single run / systemd unit write. After "
"changing `http.host`, run `anima service restart`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:79
#, no-wrap
msgid "Without Tunnel, LAN: `http://<PC-IP>:2658/web/chat` with `http.host: 0.0.0.0` (or `anima service start --host 0.0.0.0`); clients set Hub URL to `http://<PC-IP>:2658` (no `/web` suffix).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:80
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cross-origin (`http.cors_origins`)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:83
msgid ""
"When the browser UI and Hub API share the same origin (default: `https://"
"anima.example.com/web` + `https://anima.example.com/api`), **no CORS config "
"is needed**."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:85
msgid ""
"Add origins only for **cross-origin** cases (e.g. Vite dev server, external "
"reverse proxy splitting UI and API):"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:86
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"http:\n"
"  cors_origins:\n"
"    - http://127.0.0.1:4173\n"
msgstr ""
"http:\n"
"  cors_origins:\n"
"    - http://127.0.0.1:4173\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:93
msgid "CORS is **not** derived from `tunnel` or `web.public_url`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:94
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hub 本地 HTTPS（双端口，可选）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:97
msgid "Hub 可在 **独立端口** 提供原生 TLS（`Bun.serve`），与默认 HTTP 并行："
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:102
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| Port                      | Role                                                                  |\n"
#| "| ------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
#| "| `EntityStorePort.list`    | Structural filters; stable sort                                       |\n"
#| "| `EntitySearchPort.search` | Hard filters + optional text query; hybrid FTS/trigram/vector via RRF |\n"
msgid ""
"| 端口     | 协议  | 用途                                                                            |\n"
"| -------- | ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **2658** | HTTP  | 默认；Tunnel ingress、CLI 探活、日常客户端                                      |\n"
"| **2659** | HTTPS | 本地/局域网安全上下文（Web Speech 等）；客户端 Hub URL 填 `https://<host>:2659` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 端口                      | 作用                                                                  |\n"
"| ------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `EntityStorePort.list`    | 结构过滤；稳定排序                                                      |\n"
"| `EntitySearchPort.search` | 硬过滤 + 可选文本查询；经 RRF 混合 FTS/trigram/vector                 |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:104
msgid "启用（`~/.anima/config.yaml` bootstrap 段）："
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:105
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"http:\n"
"  host: 0.0.0.0\n"
"  allowed_hosts:\n"
"    - feng-vm.lan\n"
"    - 10.200.200.10\n"
"  tls:\n"
"    enabled: true\n"
"    port: 2659\n"
"    auto: true\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:120
msgid ""
"**`auto: true`**（默认）：首次启动在 `~/.anima/tls/` 自动生成 cert/key（优先 "
"**mkcert**，否则 **openssl 自签**）；SAN 含 `localhost`、`127.0.0.1`、`::1`、"
"`http.host` 中的 bind 地址（跳过 `0.0.0.0`）及 **`http.allowed_hosts`**。配置"
"变更导致 SAN 不足时，**重启 Hub 会自动删除旧证书并重签**（`auto: false` 时仅"
"告警，不覆盖手动证书）。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:120
msgid "**Tunnel 不变**：cloudflared 仍指向 `http://127.0.0.1:2658`。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:120
msgid ""
"**探活**：`anima service status` 与 `GET /hub/rpc/v1/health/probe` 仍走 HTTP "
"`:2658`。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ####
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:121
#, no-wrap
msgid "mkcert 根 CA 导入手机（可选）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:124
msgid ""
"Hub 服务器证书在 Hub 机器上；手机浏览器/APK 无警告访问须在各设备安装 "
"**mkcert 根 CA**（`rootCA.pem`，非 `cert.pem`）："
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:127
msgid ""
"**设置 → 连接**（`/web/settings?section=hub`）：页面底部提供 **rootCA.pem 下"
"载**与 **二维码**（二维码指向 HTTP `:2658` 下载链接，便于未信任 HTTPS 时扫"
"码）。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:127
msgid ""
"若 HTTPS 页面脚本仍报错，请先用 **`http://<host>:2658/web/settings?"
"section=hub`** 打开设置页。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:128
#, no-wrap
msgid "mkcert -CAROOT   # 查看 rootCA.pem 路径\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:134
msgid ""
"**iOS**：AirDrop/邮件传 `rootCA.pem` → 安装描述文件 → **设置 → 通用 → 关于本"
"机 → 证书信任设置** → 启用完全信任。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:134
msgid "**Android**：可选转 DER 后 **设置 → 安全 → 安装 CA 证书**。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:136
msgid ""
"日常手机远程访问仍推荐 **Tunnel HTTPS** 或 **HTTP `:2658`**，避免逐台装 CA。"
"Capacitor APK 对 user CA 的支持因平台/构建而异。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:137
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Tunnel (optional)"
msgstr "2. Tunnel（可选）"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:139
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"anima tunnel setup\n"
"anima service start\n"
msgstr ""
"anima tunnel setup\n"
"anima service start\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:145
msgid ""
"When `tunnel.enabled: true`, cloudflared starts with **`anima service "
"start`** stack (no separate `anima-tunnel.service`). Ingress points to Hub "
"`:2658` only; Web UI is served at **`/web`** on the same hostname."
msgstr ""
"当 `tunnel.enabled: true` 时，cloudflared 随 **`anima service start`** 栈启动"
"（无独立 `anima-tunnel.service`）。Ingress 默认指向本地 Hub `:2658`；配置 "
"`tunnel.web_hostname` 与 `web.enabled` 时，第二条 ingress 指向 Web `:2659`。"

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:146
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"tunnel:\n"
"  enabled: true\n"
"  hostname: anima.example.com\n"
"\n"
"web:\n"
"  enabled: true\n"
"  public_url: https://anima.example.com/web\n"
msgstr ""
"tunnel:\n"
"  enabled: true\n"
"  hostname: anima.example.com\n"
"  web_hostname: app.anima.example.com\n"
"\n"
"web:\n"
"  enabled: true\n"
"  port: 2659\n"
"  public_url: https://app.anima.example.com\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:157
msgid ""
"Browser: `https://anima.example.com/web/chat` · Hub API: `https://"
"anima.example.com/api`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:159
#, no-wrap
msgid "Without Tunnel, LAN: `http://<PC-IP>:2658/web/chat` with `http.host: 0.0.0.0` in config (see above); clients set Hub URL to `http://<PC-IP>:2658` (no `/web` suffix).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:160
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cloudflare credentials"
msgstr "Cloudflare 凭证"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:163
msgid ""
"Store API token and tunnel connector JSON via `env(\"KEY\")` or "
"`vault(\"item_id\", \"field\")` in `config.yaml` tunnel section. See wizard "
"`anima tunnel setup`."
msgstr ""
"在 `config.yaml` 的 tunnel 段使用 `env(\"KEY\")` 或 `vault(\"item_id\", "
