#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:164
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Client configuration"
msgstr "3. 客户端配置"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:167
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Desktop shell** (`src/app/shell/desktop`), **mobile shell** (`src/app/shell/mobile`), and **browser Web** are remote clients; they **do not read** Hub `config.yaml` token.\n"
msgstr "**桌面壳层**（`src/app/shell/desktop`）、**移动壳层**（`src/app/shell/mobile`）与 **浏览器 Web**（`web.enabled` + Tunnel 或局域网 `:2659`）为远程客户端；它们**不读取** Hub `config.yaml` 中的 token。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:173
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| Client      | Storage                                          |\n"
#| "| ----------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n"
#| "| Desktop shell | `~/.anima-desktop/settings.json` (`hub` section) |\n"
#| "| Mobile shell  | Capacitor Preferences                            |\n"
#| "| Browser Web | localStorage (settings page)                     |\n"
msgid ""
"| Client        | Storage                                          |\n"
"| ------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| Desktop shell | `~/.anima-desktop/settings.json` (`hub` section) |\n"
"| Mobile shell  | Capacitor Preferences                            |\n"
"| Browser Web   | localStorage (settings page)                     |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 客户端      | 存储                                      |\n"
"| ----------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Desktop shell | `~/.anima-desktop/settings.json`（`hub` 段） |\n"
"| Mobile shell  | Capacitor Preferences                        |\n"
"| Browser Web | localStorage（设置页）                 |\n"

